.TH LOCALSEARCH 1 "October 2026" "localsearch 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
localsearch \- natural-language search over local files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B localsearch
.SH DESCRIPTION
Local-first semantic file search. Ask in plain words
(e.g. "photo where I wore a blue tshirt") and get ranked results
with relevancy scores. 100% on-device.
.PP
The app needs the localsearch backend on http://127.0.0.1:39281.
